# Ninja Gaiden Black (5443000D), Nova. Built from the generic survey
# 1790941402-titleroutes2-1890328 (lane.titleroutes2 session 1,
# 2026-10-02). Read from its route-frames, not guessed:
#   boot20 (050613): the copyright warning; boot40: the intro movie;
#     booted (050656): "PRESS START BUTTON".
#   cycle 1 (050702 START / 050707 A): MAIN MENU, NEW GAME lit; A starts
#     it, and the prologue narration begins ("...of a Black Dragon").
#   cycles 2-13 (050714-050842): the prologue ("of ancient myth", "This
#     sword", "of young Ninja Ryu Hayabusa..."). START and A did not skip
#     it.
#   cycles 13-19 (050847-050940): "The Book of the Fiends" text over
#     "Now Loading..." (~95 s).
#   play loop (051006): "CHAPTER 1 / The Way of the Ninja", "Proceed";
#     the loop's A took it, and 051030 is the chapter's opening cutscene
#     (Ryu above a waterfall). The 300 s window ended there.
# So: 20 START/A cycles (reach the chapter card, ~260 s after launch, and
# take it), then START to skip the opening cutscene, then B three times
# (B closes the START menu if a START landed in play; in play B is a
# thrown shuriken), mark, then a play loop with no START: run forward on
# the left stick, X/Y combos, A jump, small RX camera turns.
# [guess] that START skips the cutscene (the frames will show it), and
# where play starts. NOT YET REPLAYED: launch to play is ~4.5 min, so a
# 420 s replay scores ~2 min.
wait 20
shot boot20
wait 20
shot boot40
wait 20
shot booted
repeat 20 {
    press START
    wait 5
    shot menu-start
    press A
    wait 5
    shot menu-a
}
press START
wait 4
shot skip1
press START
wait 4
shot skip2
press B
wait 1.5
press B
wait 1.5
press B
wait 2
shot pre-mark
mark gameplay               # CHECK: Ryu under player control, the health bar up, no menu or cutscene
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 2
    press X
    wait 0.3
    press X
    wait 0.3
    press Y
    wait 0.6
    press A
    wait 1
    axis RX max
    wait 0.5
    axis RX mid
    wait 2
    press Y
    wait 0.4
    press X
    wait 0.5
    shot play1
    axis LY mid
    axis LX max
    wait 1.5
    axis LX mid
    axis LY min
    wait 2
    press A
    wait 0.4
    press X
    wait 1
    axis RX min
    wait 0.3
    axis RX mid
    shot play2
}
